          "text_preview": "(Https://Ncda.Gov.Ph/) Downloadable Files: 1. Amended IRR BP 344 Official Gazette – PDF File (https://ncda.gov.ph/wp- content/uploads/2024/08/amended-IRR-BP-344-Official-Gazette.pdf) BP 344 IMPLEMENTING RULES AND REGULATIONS (IRR) AMENDMENTS MINIMUM REQUIREMENTS FOR ACCESSIBILITY 1. GENERAL PROVISIONS 1. Accessible Ramps Republic of the Philippines National Council on Disability Affairs Pambansang Sanggunian Ukol sa Ugnayang Pangmaykapansanan  2651033 Total Registered Persons With Disabilities "
